WineMetalGL: x87sidecar --serve-pid=<pid>, a cooperative attach to a process
that is already running (winemetalgl.so starts the sidecar for its own pid and
performs the handshake itself; src/wine/unix/unix_x87.c). Applied to
github.com/athei/x87sidecar at third_party/x87sidecar/REVISION by
scripts/build-x87sidecar.sh.

